{"text": "El granjero cambió el nido de lugar y lo revisó una y otra vez. La gallina dejó de descansar tranquila. Al día siguiente no apareció ningún huevo. La granjera vio el nido revuelto y preguntó qué estaba pasando. Granjera: Necesita tranquilidad, no que la molestemos.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.330624, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.345375, "end": 0.921333, "from": 3, "to": 11}, {"start": 0.936125, "end": 1.320125, "from": 12, "to": 18}, {"start": 1.334833, "end": 1.467749, "from": 19, "to": 21}, {"start": 1.482541, "end": 1.777916, "from": 22, "to": 26}, {"start": 1.792666, "end": 1.910832, "from": 27, "to": 29}, {"start": 1.925583, "end": 2.309583, "from": 30, "to": 35}, {"start": 2.324333, "end": 2.398166, "from": 36, "to": 37}, {"start": 2.412958, "end": 2.545874, "from": 38, "to": 40}, {"start": 2.560625, "end": 3.048, "from": 41, "to": 47}, {"start": 3.06275, "end": 3.372875, "from": 48, "to": 51}, {"start": 3.387666, "end": 3.535332, "from": 52, "to": 53}, {"start": 3.550125, "end": 3.830708, "from": 54, "to": 58}, {"start": 3.8455, "end": 4.318083, "from": 59, "to": 62}, {"start": 5.346166, "end": 5.538166, "from": 64, "to": 66}, {"start": 5.552916, "end": 6.040291, "from": 67, "to": 74}, {"start": 6.055041, "end": 6.394707, "from": 75, "to": 79}, {"start": 6.4095, "end": 6.512875, "from": 80, "to": 82}, {"start": 6.527666, "end": 7.251332, "from": 83, "to": 92}, {"start": 7.266083, "end": 7.945416, "from": 93, "to": 102}, {"start": 8.979208, "end": 9.215499, "from": 104, "to": 106}, {"start": 9.23025, "end": 9.466541, "from": 107, "to": 110}, {"start": 9.481333, "end": 10.101624, "from": 111, "to": 120}, {"start": 10.116375, "end": 10.382208, "from": 121, "to": 123}, {"start": 10.396958, "end": 10.958166, "from": 124, "to": 132}, {"start": 10.972958, "end": 11.415999, "from": 133, "to": 139}, {"start": 11.43075, "end": 11.859041, "from": 140, "to": 145}, {"start": 12.878083, "end": 13.070083, "from": 147, "to": 149}, {"start": 13.0848